    {
      "id": "IAfzQ3wz3Gppg4CJYegFv",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 741.6844647355099,
      "y": 2191.604172289191,
      "width": 1163.1790771484375,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b24",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 718122606,
      "version": 240,
      "versionNonce": 1633468891,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1789548994419,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "\"xterm.js A high-performance React terminal designed to render incremental stream outputs (e.g., from WebContainers).\"",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "\"xterm.js A high-performance React terminal designed to render incremental stream outputs (e.g., from WebContainers).\"",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "vB0GbZdADVzJZsXX5k9we",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 740.0330380189816,
      "y": 2229.318258865879,
      "width": 817.119384765625,
      "height": 125,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b25",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 140200174,
      "version": 224,
      "versionNonce": 19733845,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1789548994419,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Key Features:\n * - Initializes a customized headless terminal instance on mount with auto-cleanup.\n * - Handles automatic responsive resizing via ResizeObserver and FitAddon.\n * - Tracks output length incrementally to efficiently append only new data chunks.\n * - Automatically clears and resets the buffer if a state reset/restart occurs.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Key Features:\n * - Initializes a customized headless terminal instance on mount with auto-cleanup.\n * - Handles automatic responsive resizing via ResizeObserver and FitAddon.\n * - Tracks output length incrementally to efficiently append only new data chunks.\n * - Automatically clears and resets the buffer if a state reset/restart occurs.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "5AIxLU59h56G_jdi0t4Q7",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 738.3637863541821,
      "y": 1545.4917208476038,
      "width": 1326.0191650390625,
      "height": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b25G",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 192180795,
      "version": 316,
      "versionNonce": 977551867,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1789548902003,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": " * - Converts a flat array of Convex file documents into a nested hierarchical FileSystemTree structure required by WebContainer.\n * - Traverses parent ID chains for each file to construct complete directory paths from the root down to individual files and folders.\n * - Populates directory nodes and file contents (skipping items with external storage IDs) to mirror the project workspace accurately.\n ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": " * - Converts a flat array of Convex file documents into a nested hierarchical FileSystemTree structure required by WebContainer.\n * - Traverses parent ID chains for each file to construct complete directory paths from the root down to individual files and folders.\n * - Populates directory nodes and file contents (skipping items with external storage IDs) to mirror the project workspace accurately.\n ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "HbQbS_TPEtPZAXMiZqRQa",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 741.6857017167767,
      "y": 1876.8795753865925,
      "width": 1618.2587890625,
      "height": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b25O",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 895750491,
      "version": 384,
      "versionNonce": 68497691,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1789549074849,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": " * - Manages the complete lifecycle of a WebContainer instance, handling singleton initialization, cleanup, and state transitions (idle, booting, installing, running, error).\n * - Automatically mounts project files, runs dependency installation and development server commands, and captures live terminal output streams.\n * - Synchronizes real-time file edits into the virtual file system and provides manual restart capabilities to ensure seamless live previews.\n ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": " * - Manages the complete lifecycle of a WebContainer instance, handling singleton initialization, cleanup, and state transitions (idle, booting, installing, running, error).\n * - Automatically mounts project files, runs dependency installation and development server commands, and captures live terminal output streams.\n * - Synchronizes real-time file edits into the virtual file system and provides manual restart capabilities to ensure seamless live previews.\n ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "OhFEjbX4f2Qb1uTUiRuwU",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 730.3929557989688,
      "y": 2550.05207282232,
      "width": 1168.7591552734375,
      "height": 125,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b25V",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1893711445,
      "version": 402,
      "versionNonce": 1237175931,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1789548994419,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "\n * - Provides a popover interface to configure and update the project settings and install/dev commands for a project.\n * - Utilizes TanStack Form combined with Zod validation for robust and efficient state management.\n * - Employs the form.Subscribe pattern to isolate and optimize rendering exclusively for the submit button \n     without re-rendering the entire form.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "\n * - Provides a popover interface to configure and update the project settings and install/dev commands for a project.\n * - Utilizes TanStack Form combined with Zod validation for robust and efficient state management.\n * - Employs the form.Subscribe pattern to isolate and optimize rendering exclusively for the submit button \n     without re-rendering the entire form.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "7zFK7KozuBeU3EicYRcDz",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 730.8652049855132,
      "y": 2944.9089072961833,
      "width": 1288.9791259765625,
      "height": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b25l",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 129036827,
      "version": 518,
      "versionNonce": 346598069,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1789548994419,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "\n * - Manages and displays the WebContainer project preview environment, including its URL state, loading phases, and error handling.\n * - Provides a control header with action buttons to restart the container, toggle the terminal view, and open preview settings.\n * - Uses a split-pane layout via Allotment to render the live web preview alongside a collapsible interactive terminal.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "\n * - Manages and displays the WebContainer project preview environment, including its URL state, loading phases, and error handling.\n * - Provides a control header with action buttons to restart the container, toggle the terminal view, and open preview settings.\n * - Uses a split-pane layout via Allotment to render the live web preview alongside a collapsible interactive terminal.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
